sequenceDiagram
  participant C as client
  participant A as zone A radosgw
  participant I as A index shard
  participant DL as A data_log.N
  participant B as zone B radosgw
  C->>A: PUT logs/k
  A->>I: complete_op → bilog entry (zones_trace)
