  A-->>B: notify modified shard N
  B->>DL: datalog list after marker
  B->>I: bilog list shard 7 after inc_marker
  B->>A: GET object (sync manifest, attrs)
  B->>B: write locally if newer · zones_trace += A
  Note over B: advance markers in datalog.sync-status.shard and bucket.sync-status
